OL,3,AWould you buy branded clothing from
OL,4,Ayour favourite tech firm?
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor Natalie Fratto, putting on her dark
OL,7,Fgreen jumper from US microchip giant
OL,8,FNvidia is like wearing the kit from a
OL,9,Ffavourite sports team.
OL,11,FOn the front of the $178 (#132) woollen
OL,12,Fgarment is a cartoonish image of the
OL,13,Ftech company's boss Jensen Huang.
OL,15,FFratto doesn't work for Nvidia.
OL,16,FInstead, she's a fan of the company.
OL,18,F"I have a New Zealand All Blacks rugby
OL,19,Fjersey, and I think of my Jensen
OL,20,Fsweater in kind of the same way," says
OL,21,FNew York-based Fratto, who runs a tech
OL,22,Fstart-up.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
